{
    "name": "5/3/1 Building the Monolith",
    "displayName": "5/3/1 Building the Monolith",
    "description": "Jim Wendler's 5/3/1 'Building the Monolith' template: 3 days/week for 6 weeks. Percentages are based on Training Max (TM). Weeks 1-3 run a 3-week wave; before Week 4 you adjust TMs for squat, deadlift, press, and bench (commonly +5 lb upper body, +10 lb lower body, or as appropriate) and then repeat the wave for Weeks 4-6. Monday is Squat + Press plus high-rep bodyweight assistance. Wednesday is Deadlift + Bench plus rows and curls. Friday is Squat + 20-rep set plus high-volume Press and weighted chins/upper back work. Conditioning is expected alongside this template.",
    "rounding": 5,
    "manual_progression": true,
